								"draggable": true,
								"content": "This past year, your generosity has enabled us to go out in joy and serve.&nbsp; You have helped us lead people forth in peace, offering material assistance wrapped in dignity, hope, and compassion. Your support has transformed despair into joy, filling empty hands and inspiring hope.&nbsp;",
